description:
[claude] Design: https://vishal7pandey.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ANVIL/pages/30146561 (proposed, waiting for owner approval).

Translate our run events to AG-UI at the API edge; frontend AG-UI reducer behind `VITE_PROTOCOL=agui`; a catalog of agent-chosen components (ApprovalCard, TestResultsCard, DiffCard, PlanChecklist, then AskUserCard, RootCause, KBEvidence, CI, Budget). Static plus narrow-declarative generative UI only; no agent-authored markup.

**Phases (stories get cut once the owner approves):**

* 0: spec pin + fixtures;
* 1: translator + endpoints (devin);
* 2: reducer at parity (cline);
* 3: HITL and test/diff/plan cards;
* 4: the rest of the catalog;
* 5: default on.

**Timing:** nothing before the 11-06 demo. Phases 1–3 for 11-10 only if Friday's dry run is clean.
